sysmanage-canary, the outside watcher for this server, is installed but
not enabled.  It is best run on another machine; to run it here:

  1. Edit ${SYSCONFDIR}/sysmanage-canary.yaml (server URLs, a read-only
     database role, the mail server and who to alert).
  2. sysmanage-canary --config ${SYSCONFDIR}/sysmanage-canary.yaml --check-config
     sysmanage-canary --config ${SYSCONFDIR}/sysmanage-canary.yaml --test-email
  3. rcctl enable sysmanage_canary && rcctl start sysmanage_canary
     (the first start creates its _sysmanage_canary user)
